; THE HOLLOW COURT (hidden realm) — the Hollow Queen's palace and the ring in its forecourt.
; Authored in the content frame; tools/shift_cell_content.py moves it to the spec's origin.
;
; ⚠️ LOAD-BEARING NODES, mirrored from scenes/regions/ember_crown/arena.tscn:
;   Brazier/Summon     BossSummonComponent — the Queen rises at brazier + SpawnOffset, the ring centre
;   AddSpawns/Spawn*   found by GROUP "boss_add_spawn"
;   GraveLights/*      hidden OmniLights the phase hooks reveal; Phase2Hook/Phase3Hook reset on death
; ⚠️ The ring (content (0, 10), 14 m) stays bare. The hall is a landmark hull, not an interior:
; the Iron Citadel's fortress model at 0.55 scale (placeholder until the realm gets its own palace).

